{
  "description": "Antigravity: a non-streamed Chat request to Cloud Code goes to generateContent; the reply's text becomes the Chat message and its thought part reasoning. The request goes inside Cloud Code's envelope with the account's project, and the reply comes out of its response field.",
  "source": [
    "core/internal/runtime/executor/antigravity_executor_request.go",
    "core/internal/runtime/executor/antigravity_executor_stream.go",
    "core/internal/runtime/executor/antigravity_executor_execute.go",
    "core/internal/translator/antigravity/openai/chat-completions"
